OL,3,GNEWSAUK robotics hubs to drive adoption
OL,4,Aof new tech
OL,5,
OL,6,FEight new Robotics Adoption Hubs are to
OL,7,Fbe rolled out across the UK, the
OL,8,Fgovernment has announced.
OL,10,FThe hubs will get #40m to offer advice
OL,11,Fand support to businesses and public
OL,12,Fservices looking to use the latest
OL,13,Ftechnologies and switch to automation.
OL,15,FOne, in Newcastle, will help healthcare
OL,16,Fproviders adopt robotic-assisted
OL,17,Fsurgery while another, in Lincoln, will
OL,18,Fassist the farming and food industries
OL,19,Fwith innovations such as automated
OL,20,Ffruit-picking machines.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
